This Letter presents Standard Model predictions for the rare kaon decays $K^- 	o \ell^-  ar{
u}_\ell \ell'^+ \ell'^-$ ($K_{\ell2\ell'}$) using the first complete lattice QCD computation of structure-dependent form factors. Branching fractions for all four channels ($\ell, \ell' = e, \mu$) are predicted with 2–7% precision, showing agreement with existing experimental data and a preliminary NA62 result. The theoretical results also enable a 1.8% extraction of $|V_{us}| = 0.2283(42)$ from the two most precise channels, demonstrating the potential of these decays as precision probes of SM flavor structure.



本文基于首个完整的格点QCD对结构依赖形状因子的计算，给出了稀有介子衰变 $K^- 	o \ell^-  ar{
u}_\ell \ell'^+ \ell'^-$（即 $K_{\ell2\ell'}$）在标准模型下的预言。四个通道（$\ell, \ell' = e, \mu$）的分支比精度达2%–7%，与已有实验数据及NA62初步结果一致。利用其中两个最精确的通道（$K_{\mu2e}$ 和 $K_{\mu2\mu}$），可提取出 $|V_{us}| = 0.2283(42)$，精度达1.8%，展示了这些衰变作为标准模型味结构高精度探针的潜力。
